# Monday Brief Output Directory

This directory stores Monday morning briefs generated by the Monday Brief system.

Files are named: YYYY-MM-DD_monday-brief.md

The briefs contain:
- System health check (disk, memory, CPU, git)
- Weekly work summary (sessions, learnings)
- Key highlights and accomplishments
- This week's priorities

Generated automatically every Monday at 9 AM (via launchd/cron) or manually with:
  bun run tools/monday-brief.ts --force
